==Trivia==
*Unlike the Japanese version, the International version did not receive an update missions gift.
*The official announcement for the International version's update went out live on August 1st, 2026 on its eShop page.
*Due to this update, numerous units now reflect the current mobile descriptions as of Version [[Version 15.5 Update|15.5]]
**The following Cat Units are: Ninja Cat, Capsule Cat, Flower Cat, Swordsman Cat, Cat Gunslinger, Tin Cat, Sushi Cat, Gold Cat, Crazed Titan Cat, Nurse Cat, Sanada Yukimura, Maeda Keiji, Oda Nobunaga, Date Masamune, Takeda Shingen, Thundia, Kuu, Megidora, Sodom, Vars, Raiden, Urashima Taro, and Mekako Saionji

